.\" man page create by R# package system.
.TH BACKGROUND 2 2000-1月 "clusterInfo" "clusterInfo"
.SH NAME
clusterInfo \- Get the cluster information data table of a specific cluster.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIclusterInfo(\fBbackground\fR as <generic> Background, 
\fBclusterId\fR as string);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the cluster information data table of a specific cluster.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBbackground\fB \fR\- the GSEA background model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBclusterId\fB \fR\- the cluster id (or the pathway id) that will be query from the background model.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a \fBdataframe\fR of the cluster member genes, the row names are the gene ids and
 the columns are \fBclusterId\fR, \fBclusterName\fR, \fBname\fR, \fBlocus_tag\fR,
 \fBdescription\fR and \fBterms\fR. An empty \fBdataframe\fR will be returned when the
 cluster id is not found.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
background
.SH FILES
.PP
gseakit.dll
.PP
